        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPresenting No. 90 Exchange Hall.This one bedroom apartment comes to the market in excellent condition throughout, boasting a spacious living area and fully fitted kitchen.The development benefits from its close proximity to all amenities from restaurants and pubs to shops and buses - the list is endless, this particular apartment has a beautiful view of the Dublin mountains from the balcony.Also within short walking distance is The Square shopping centre, Tallaght Stadium, Sean Walsh Memorial Park and Tallaght Hospital. Accommodation briefly comprises living/dining area, balcony, kitchen, double bedroom and family bathroom. Call or email for viewing details."
